      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Located off William Street & set in a private courtyard in the heart of Kilkenny City is 6 Wesley Court, a two-bedroom ground floor apartment. \r\n\r\nPresented in good condition and recently painted the property would make an ideal first-time buyer home or may be suitable as an investment property.\r\n\r\nWesley Court is a three-storey development of 21 apartments in the centre of Kilkenny City just off the high street.\r\n\r\n."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation:\r\n•\tEntrance Hall – Large storage unit.\r\n•\tOpen Plan Kitchen / Dining room/ Sitting room.\r\n•\tShower Room\r\n\tShower Room\r\n•\tDouble Bedroom\r\n•\tSingle Bedroom\r\nExternally:\r\n\r\nPrivate courtyard to the front.\r\nServices:\r\n•\tElectric Heating\r\n•\tMains water\r\n•\tFibre broadband up to (2gb- subject to survey). Source Vodafone."
      },
